---
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import OperatingExperience from '@/components/ui/OperatingExperience.astro';
---
<Layout>
<div class="growth-page"><section class="growth-page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow-accent">MEHUL · FOUNDER, MlabsGrowth</p><h1>Mehul, founder of MLabs.<br /><em>I run the same operations you do.</em></h1><p class="growth-lead">I’m Mehul. I run two D2C brands and build the systems underneath them — store conversion, COD and delivery follow-up, marketing workflows. MLabs is me building that same layer for other brands, and explaining how it works so your team can run it.</p></section>
<section class="section-space growth-evidence"><div class="shell growth-split"><div><h2 class="section-title">The questions came<br />from our own operations.</h2><p>Seasonal products and jewellery create different kinds of pressure. Orders need confirming. Stock needs checking. Marketing needs context. And when a workflow gets stuck at 9pm on a festive weekend, somebody still has to decide what happens next.</p><p>That is why we do not open with a tool. We start with one recurring problem, check the tools and data actually behind it, and agree what a useful improvement would look like before anything is built.</p><p>The brands shown here are owned businesses under one parent, not independent clients. We do not present their experience as a guarantee for your business.</p></div><OperatingExperience /></div></section>
<section class="section-space shell"><p class="eyebrow-accent">ONE BUSINESS · TWO WAYS TO WORK WITH US</p><div class="growth-split"><article><h2 class="section-title">Build it with us.</h2><p>Brand services cover Shopify conversion, order operations and AI workflows. We agree the scope, responsibilities and costs before implementation. Your team remains part of the decisions and handover.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services#services">See the services ↗</a></article><article><h2 class="section-title">Run it yourself.</h2><p>Skill Manager and future digital products are the product side of MLabs. The aim is to turn repeatable work into something you can manage yourself, with clear instructions and an output worth reviewing.</p><a class="text-link" href="/products">Explore the products ↗</a></article></div></section>
<section class="section-space growth-product-band"><div class="shell growth-callout"><div><h2>Bring a real problem.</h2><p>Tell me what takes too long, gets missed, or still depends on you every single day. Thirty minutes, free, and you keep the ranked list either way.</p></div><a class="growth-button" href={site.bookingUrl} data-cta-location="about-audit">Book my free audit call ↗</a></div></section></div>
</Layout>
